Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can an AI agent refund on its own?\NSounds risky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ReturnLens says not yet: damage refunds\Nstay locked on the live demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The courier confirms the return parcel.\NDoes the agent refund immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here. It drafts a refund proposal,\Nand waits for seller review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? One of its tests is synthetic,\Nand that never counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the multi-case inbox:\Norder facts, seen evidence, unverified.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,An immutable audit drawer\Ntracks every single event in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A customer asks where her order is.\NThe agent checks live Delhivery data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediate tracking status and ETA,\Nanswered without human delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:01:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Delivery failed for Sneha Patil.\NThe agent reaches out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She texts an address change in Hinglish:\NFlat 14B, tomorrow at 6 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Parsed into a reattempt proposal,\Nscheduled with a single click.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, multimodal evidence:\Nan unboxing clip and English voice note.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The catalog says white headphones.\NAt 00:10, vision spots black!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guessing, no false claims.\NThe box barcode remains unverified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero rogue proposals created:\Ntransferred directly to human review.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A dark video shows no visible damage.\NThe agent asks once for a clear photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The customer leaves and returns later...\Nthe entire chat and context restore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It remembers preferred language Hinglish,\Nso it never asks twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How does an agent earn autonomy?\NBy passing 5 of 5 runs in the harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,9 of 10 scenarios pass 5 of 5.\NMismatch sits at 4 of 5... locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nervous? One click on the kill switch\Ntakes back total control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to break it in the sandbox:\Nprompt injection neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Over-refunds and velocity attacks:\Nhard-blocked by code invariants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ReturnLens.\NEvery decision, backed by evidence.
